WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.833
(audience applauds)

00:00:00.833 --> 00:00:02.250
- So when you were a kid,

00:00:02.250 --> 00:00:04.003
what kind of music were you into?

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:07.170
And especially growing up in Egypt,

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.690
that had to have a different
kind of influence, right?

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.960
- Dude, all my pictures when I was a kid,

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:15.110
I was in the full outfit,

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.300
but really I'm trying to
just dance around the fact

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:19.480
of your question of what did
I listen to when I was a kid?

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.495
And I'm like, I loved the
boy bands for a little bit.

00:00:23.495 --> 00:00:24.328
(audience cheering)

00:00:24.328 --> 00:00:26.330
- You did, I loved it, I love that.

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:28.650
- Well, I was in second grade.

00:00:28.650 --> 00:00:29.900
- There was some great melodies there.

00:00:29.900 --> 00:00:31.450
- For sure, for sure.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:32.823
They hold up in time.

00:00:34.317 --> 00:00:36.960
I was definitely in second grade like,

00:00:36.960 --> 00:00:38.620
all right here, just watch me, watch me,

00:00:38.620 --> 00:00:40.207
and I'll do like my.

00:00:40.207 --> 00:00:41.070
(audience laughs)

00:00:41.070 --> 00:00:43.700
- Oh my gosh, I want this footage.

00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:46.610
- And then I went to a
Backstreet Boys concert

00:00:46.610 --> 00:00:48.010
and I threw up on the first song

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.410
because the girls were so loud,

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.360
they were screaming so loud.

00:00:50.360 --> 00:00:52.648
I don't know how that equaled
out to me throwing up but...

00:00:52.648 --> 00:00:53.590
(audience laughs)

00:00:53.590 --> 00:00:54.423
- It's overwhelming.

00:00:54.423 --> 00:00:55.256
- I know what happened though.

00:00:55.256 --> 00:00:57.840
Like they came down on these hover boards

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.503
and everyone was going so crazy.

00:01:02.140 --> 00:01:03.040
I was going...

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.740
(Machine mumbling)

00:01:04.740 --> 00:01:05.573
(audience laughs)

00:01:05.573 --> 00:01:06.406
- It's a lie.

00:01:06.406 --> 00:01:08.020
- And then I left and then
the next concert I returned to

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.699
was Destiny's Child.

00:01:09.699 --> 00:01:10.532
(audience applauds)

00:01:10.532 --> 00:01:12.213
- I love you so much right now.

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:16.510
- Which is why because
Nelly was opening up

00:01:16.510 --> 00:01:19.450
and he had this song "Ride
With Me" and when he said,

00:01:19.450 --> 00:01:23.240
hey, is it pass me the money
or it must be the money?

00:01:23.240 --> 00:01:24.090
- [Clarkson] Must be the money.

00:01:24.090 --> 00:01:24.923
- Okay it must be the money.

00:01:24.923 --> 00:01:27.700
So when that happened, money with his face

00:01:27.700 --> 00:01:28.914
fell from the ceiling.

00:01:28.914 --> 00:01:30.500
(Clarkson laughs)

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:31.460
- That's amazing.

00:01:31.460 --> 00:01:34.851
- Yeah, and I was with my dad
and my dad was just so lost.

00:01:34.851 --> 00:01:35.684
(audience laughs)

